hi all.

this patch is aimed at slashem patch writers.

this patch allows for easier adding of dungeon glyphs/tiles by patch
creators.

it removes the hard-coded S_foo from rm.h and replaces it with an include
of "dgn_char.h".  dgn_char.h is generated by "makedefs -c" using
dgn_char.in as input.  simply add you un-numbered glyph into dgn_char.in
and makedefs will recreate / renumber the glyphs input into rm.h.

i wrote this patch because i'm working on a number of visual extensions to
both nethack and slashem and found the dungeon glyph renumbering process a
bit tedious.

find the patch here : 
http://www.linuxgames.co.za/NetHack/patches/dgnchar/se007e5-auto_dgnchar.diff

